# The ST Cube set this board pins -- HAL, CMSIS device, CMSIS core -- fetched at
# configure time by cmake/fetch_upstream.cmake (pinned commits in board.cmake,
# issues #136 / #177), one <repo>-<commit> directory each, shared by every build
# directory of this clone.  Deliberately NOT git submodules: ST pairs these per
# Cube package, so each board names its own commits.  The trees are treated
# read-only, like the root lib/ mirrors: adjustments live in the port, never in
# lib/.  Delete a directory to have the next configure fetch it again.
/lib/
